sequenceDiagram
    participant RV as Reviewer
    participant FE as Audit UI
    participant API as API
    participant MS as moderationService
    participant D as MongoDB
    RV->>FE: "Re-run Machine Scan (All)"
    FE->>API: POST /api/submissions/moderation/rescan-all
    API->>D: load all submissions
    loop each submission
        API->>MS: scanContent(title,abstract,content,tags)
        MS-->>API: {grade, scores, matches, labels}
        API->>D: overwrite moderation subdocument
    end
    API-->>FE: {rescanned: n}
    FE->>API: GET /api/submissions/moderation/audit
    API-->>FE: aggregate counters + per-item rows
    FE-->>RV: refreshed dashboard
